        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-time-feasibility-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Say whether there is time to act",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "来得及 and 来不及 say whether enough time remains for an action. These fixed forms describe time feasibility, not literal coming or general ability.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "现在走还来得及。",
                "pinyin": "xiànzài zǒu hái láidejí 。",
                "meaning": "There is still time if we leave now.",
                "audio": "0fb1f13f285c5a3b18426bcf9f5a05d57c0ead6c4feec6dff3cc64b2159dc677"
              },
              {
                "text": "我来不及吃饭了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ láibují chī fàn le 。",
                "meaning": "I do not have time to eat now.",
                "audio": "fb6d16f0aa35916ad312c37109666428b9fc3a8d99c9948de21ed34f135396c2"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
